          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon Delete State Machine Alias",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Deletes a state machine <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/step-functions/latest/dg/concepts-state-machine-alias.html\">alias</a>.</p> <p>After you delete a state machine alias, you can't use it to start executions. When you delete a state machine alias, Step Functions doesn't delete the state machine versions that alias references.</p> <p> <b>Related operations:</b> </p> <ul> <li> <p> <a>CreateStateMachineAlias</a> </p> </li> <li> <p> <a>DescribeStateMachineAlias</a> </p> </li> <li> <p> <a>ListStateMachineAliases</a> </p> </li> <li> <p> <a>UpdateStateMachineAlias</a> </p> </li> </ul>",
